# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bounding the subspace dimension for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Menghadkan dimensi subruang untuk versi terkini Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bounding the subspace dimension"
msgstr "Menghadkan dimensi subruang"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/choose-subspace-dimension.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this walkthrough, we will show the effect of the subspace dimension in the [self-consistent configuration recovery technique](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068).\n"
msgstr "Dalam panduan ini, kami akan menunjukkan kesan dimensi subruang dalam [teknik pemulihan konfigurasi swakonsisten](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*A priori*, we do not know what is the correct subspace dimension to obtain a target level of accuracy. However, we do know that increasing the subspace dimension increases the accuracy of the method. Therefore, we can study the accuracy of the predictions as a function of the subspace dimension.\n"
"Specify the molecule and its properties.\n"
msgstr ""
"*A priori*, kami tidak tahu apakah dimensi subruang yang betul untuk mencapai tahap ketepatan sasaran. Walau bagaimanapun, kami tahu bahawa meningkatkan dimensi subruang meningkatkan ketepatan kaedah ini. Oleh itu, kami boleh mengkaji ketepatan ramalan sebagai fungsi dimensi subruang.\n"
"Tentukan molekul dan sifat-sifatnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate some random bitstrings to proxy QPU samples.\n"
msgstr "Jana beberapa rentetan bit rawak sebagai proksi sampel QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call SQD with increasing batch sizes.\n"
msgstr "Panggil SQD dengan saiz kelompok yang semakin meningkat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plot shows that increasing the subspace dimension leads to more accurate results.\n"
msgstr "Plot ini menunjukkan bahawa peningkatan dimensi subruang menghasilkan keputusan yang lebih tepat.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/choose-subspace-dimension/extracted-outputs/caffd888-e89c-4aa9-8bae-4d1bb723b35e-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/choose-subspace-dimension/extracted-outputs/caffd888-e89c-4aa9-8bae-4d1bb723b35e-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting an explicit bound with `max_dim` {#setting-an-explicit-bound-with-max-dim}"
msgstr "Menetapkan had yang jelas dengan `max_dim` {#setting-an-explicit-bound-with-max-dim}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the sweep above, the subspace dimension was controlled only indirectly. `samples_per_batch` sets how many bitstrings are drawn into each batch, but the dimension of the resulting subspace is determined by how many *distinct* spin-alpha and spin-beta strings those bitstrings contain, and the pool of configurations available for subsampling grows from one configuration recovery iteration to the next. That is why the subspace dimensions on the horizontal axis above are irregular numbers that we did not pick.\n"
msgstr "Dalam sapuan di atas, dimensi subruang dikawal secara tidak langsung sahaja. `samples_per_batch` menetapkan berapa banyak rentetan bit diambil ke dalam setiap kelompok, tetapi dimensi subruang yang terhasil ditentukan oleh bilangan rentetan spin-alfa dan spin-beta yang *berbeza* yang terkandung dalam rentetan bit tersebut, dan kumpulan konfigurasi yang tersedia untuk subsampel bertambah daripada satu lelaran pemulihan konfigurasi kepada yang seterusnya. Itulah sebabnya dimensi subruang pada paksi mengufuk di atas ialah nombor yang tidak sekata yang tidak kami pilih.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `max_dim` argument of `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian` bounds the dimension directly. It limits the number of CI strings retained in each spin sector, and since the subspace is spanned by the Cartesian product of the two sectors, its dimension is the product of the two sector dimensions:\n"
msgstr "Argumen `max_dim` bagi `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian` menghadkan dimensi secara langsung. Ia mengehadkan bilangan rentetan CI yang dikekalkan dalam setiap sektor spin, dan memandangkan subruang direntangkan oleh hasil darab Cartesian bagi kedua-dua sektor, dimensinya ialah hasil darab kedua-dua dimensi sektor:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_dim=d` limits both sectors to `d` strings, so the subspace dimension is at most `d ** 2`.\n"
msgstr "`max_dim=d` mengehadkan kedua-dua sektor kepada `d` rentetan, jadi dimensi subruang paling banyak `d ** 2`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_dim=(d_a, d_b)` limits the spin-alpha and spin-beta sectors separately, so the subspace dimension is at most `d_a * d_b`. When `symmetrize_spin=True`, the two limits must be equal.\n"
msgstr "`max_dim=(d_a, d_b)` mengehadkan sektor spin-alfa dan spin-beta secara berasingan, jadi dimensi subruang paling banyak `d_a * d_b`. Apabila `symmetrize_spin=True`, kedua-dua had mestilah sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_dim=None`, the default, imposes no limit.\n"
msgstr "`max_dim=None`, iaitu lalai, tidak mengenakan sebarang had.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When a batch contains more strings than the limit allows, the least important ones are discarded: the strings passed via `include_configurations` are kept first, followed by the strings carried over from the previous iteration (see `carryover_threshold`), and the remaining slots are filled with the sampled strings in decreasing order of how often they were sampled.\n"
msgstr "Apabila sesuatu kelompok mengandungi lebih banyak rentetan daripada yang dibenarkan oleh had, rentetan yang paling kurang penting dibuang: rentetan yang diberikan melalui `include_configurations` dikekalkan dahulu, diikuti rentetan yang dibawa dari lelaran sebelumnya (lihat `carryover_threshold`), dan slot yang selebihnya diisi dengan rentetan yang disampel mengikut tertib menurun kekerapan ia disampel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because `max_dim` caps the size of the largest diagonalization that the eigenstate solver will be asked to perform, it is a convenient way to keep the solver within a runtime and memory budget: choose `samples_per_batch` generously, and let `max_dim` decide how large the subspace is allowed to grow.\n"
msgstr "Oleh sebab `max_dim` menghadkan saiz pepenjuruan terbesar yang akan diminta daripada penyelesai keadaan eigen, ia merupakan cara yang mudah untuk mengekalkan penyelesai dalam bajet masa jalan dan memori: pilih `samples_per_batch` dengan murah hati, dan biarkan `max_dim` menentukan sebesar mana subruang dibenarkan membesar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below, we repeat the study, this time holding `samples_per_batch` fixed and increasing `max_dim`.\n"
msgstr "Di bawah, kami mengulangi kajian ini, kali ini dengan `samples_per_batch` ditetapkan dan `max_dim` ditingkatkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The subspace dimension is now exactly `max_dim ** 2` in every run: it was chosen rather than discovered. Plotting both sweeps together shows that the accuracy is governed by the subspace dimension itself, whichever argument was used to arrive at it. The two curves need not coincide exactly, though. The `max_dim` runs draw 600 bitstrings per batch and then keep the most frequently sampled strings, so at a given dimension they can retain a better set of configurations than a run that reached that dimension by sampling fewer bitstrings in the first place.\n"
msgstr "Dimensi subruang kini tepat `max_dim ** 2` dalam setiap larian: ia dipilih dan bukannya ditemui. Memplot kedua-dua sapuan bersama menunjukkan bahawa ketepatan ditentukan oleh dimensi subruang itu sendiri, apa pun argumen yang digunakan untuk mencapainya. Walau bagaimanapun, kedua-dua lengkung itu tidak semestinya bertindih sepenuhnya. Larian `max_dim` mengambil 600 rentetan bit bagi setiap kelompok dan kemudian mengekalkan rentetan yang paling kerap disampel, jadi pada dimensi tertentu ia boleh mengekalkan set konfigurasi yang lebih baik berbanding larian yang mencapai dimensi itu dengan mensampel lebih sedikit rentetan bit sejak awal.\n"

